f an equation is separable, we say that the variables are *separated* when it is written in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{g(y)}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=h(x).\n$$\n\nNotice that our differentiable equation is separable since it can be written as\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={e}^{x}\\cdot y.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we separate the variables as follows:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={e}^{x}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186275415 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "498497a9-18b7-5c87-ba2a-a3d0a3acd277" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(1+{y}^{2})\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186273014} {:answer/id #uuid "6ccdbf3f-261a-5033-ad7a-fb8da9b4c6a4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{1+{y}^{2}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186273328} {:answer/id #uuid "859f2cee-efa2-5930-9204-76721a15d036" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{x}{1+{y}^{2}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186273534} {:answer/id #uuid "b4e5f98f-6df5-5917-925e-5cf8a994dbbe" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{x+x{y}^{2}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186273956} {:answer/id #uuid "edb9eaff-c07e-5bea-b51a-b0a8bb7dffb4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x+x{y}^{2})\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186274490}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6ccdbf3f-261a-5033-ad7a-fb8da9b4c6a4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{1+{y}^{2}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186273328} :answer-field/id #uuid "2c66ec11-f44d-5ea0-9bab-f5f4ea50c3bc" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186274712}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "19ae3272-f904-5fab-b502-497a3cf8e903" :question/math-academy-id "q-158023" :question/problem "Separate the variables in the following differential equation: \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=x+x{y}^{2}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "A differentiable equation is *separable* if it can be written in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=h(x)g(y).\n$$\n\nIf an equation is separable, we say that the variables are *separated* when it is written in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{g(y)}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=h(x).\n$$\n\nNotice that our differentiable equation is separable since it can be written as\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=x\\cdot (1+{y}^{2}).\n$$\n\nTherefore, we separate the variables as follows:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{1+{y}^{2}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=x\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186275416 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "04c970a2-bd06-523f-b005-7514038510f6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{3}^{x}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={3}^{-2y}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186272430} {:answer/id #uuid "2fc884cd-5940-54bf-83a9-bafec7d31a3d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{3}^{-2y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={3}^{x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186272811} {:answer/id #uuid "4267d012-84e1-5650-a821-876050fecc16" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{3}^{2y-x}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186272956} {:answer/id #uuid "69fe17c6-0f78-56f5-a6dd-99d7ec48cd7c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{3}^{-x}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={3}^{-2y}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186273302} {:answer/id #uuid "a4dbf8d6-33ad-53a7-9d46-265aac41aaf1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{3}^{2y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={3}^{x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186273811}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a4dbf8d6-33ad-53a7-9