7" :question/problem "Separate the variables in the following differential equation: \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={y}^{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\n$$" :question/worked-solution "A differentiable equation is *separable* if it can be written in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=h(x)g(y).\n$$\n\nIf an equation is separable, we say that the variables are *separated* when it is written in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{g(y)}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=h(x).\n$$\n\nNotice that our differentiable equation is separable since it can be written as\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot {y}^{2}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we separate the variables as follows:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{{y}^{2}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186275421 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "01b03335-77aa-59fa-b7e8-6e2269d546b0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186272397} {:answer/id #uuid "719ee0ff-8189-52e3-bc17-a3256803c517" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{y}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186273361} {:answer/id #uuid "7f2e38d7-f3bf-597e-9a67-9bf1f67d04c8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{y}{x}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186273480} {:answer/id #uuid "a4697080-8561-5e7e-b488-d65e1a6352a0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186273806} {:answer/id #uuid "abf0e68e-bca8-580f-9a48-d359bd48f72f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{x}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{y}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186273870}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "01b03335-77aa-59fa-b7e8-6e2269d546b0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answ